- Understanding risk factors in exposures to SARS-CoV-2 and other pathogens in the health-care work environment;
- Rethinking existing IPC medical devices and equipment based on key enabling technologies;
- Defining pragmatic protocols for guiding local implementers in executing safe and effective IPC practices;
